{
  "entry": "equipment_ability_bonus.py",
  "api": 1,
  "kind": "feature",
  "name": {
    "en": "High-quality gear grants ability bonuses",
    "ja": "高品質の装備に能力値補正が付く"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "When an epic, legendary or mythic weapon or armor is made (shop, crafting, events), it gets random ability bonuses such as STR +3, shown in the item details. Higher rarity gets more and larger bonuses. What the hero and companions wear counts wherever the game reads ability scores (damage, defense, turn order, quest events, impressions), through the loader's ability window, and shows as (+3) on the character sheet. The ability scores themselves are never changed. Items you already own get nothing",
    "ja": "epic・legendary・mythic の武器・防具が作られたとき（店・クラフト・イベント）、筋力 +3 のような能力値補正がランダムに付き、説明欄に出る。レア度が高いほど数も量も多い。主人公と仲間が身に着けている品の補正は、ローダの能力値の窓口を通して、ゲームが能力値を読むところ（火力・防御・手番の順・依頼の出来事・印象）に効き、ステータス画面の能力値に (+3) の形で出る。能力値そのものは書き換えない。もともと持っている品には付かない"
  },
  "version": "2",
  "author": "わさの, R01/Flossian",
